<title>USA: US March S&amp;P 500 futures very strong in late trade.</title>
<headline>US March S&amp;P 500 futures very strong in late trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>Jan 3 - U.S. March S&amp;P 500 futures were very strong in late trade, posting a fresh session high heading into the close. Traders said five or six buyers driving the gains. One trader said he expected market to close on its high, possibly near 756.70 to 756.80.</p>
<p>((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750/E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
